{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"fcaa20905e646fef52638ee11406d121669ccd5d9c1cdf8154b5f6c31cc2988f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2452},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["求助的祈禱"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["大衛的詩，交與伶長。調用第八。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，求你幫助，因虔誠人斷絕了；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世人中間的忠信人沒有了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人人向鄰舍說謊；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們說話，是嘴唇油滑，心口不一。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"凡油滑的嘴唇和誇大的舌頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華必要剪除。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們曾說：我們必能以舌頭得勝；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們的嘴唇是我們自己的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰能作我們的主呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：因為困苦人的冤屈","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和貧窮人的歎息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我現在要起來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把他安置在他所切慕的穩妥之地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華的言語是純淨的言語，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同銀子在泥爐中煉過七次。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，你必保護他們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必保佑他們永遠脫離這世代的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"下流人在世人中升高，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就有惡人到處遊行。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}